-- Spanish (Spain) (esES): the guide forever/class/warlock/dread-mage-hat (forever/class/warlock/dread-mage-hat.guide).
-- Written by `forge i18n guides sync esES`, which keeps every translation (docs/TRANSLATING.md, "Guide texts").
-- Translate the right-hand sides; "" shows the English. Keep each {kind:id} as it is: the game shows its
-- name there in Spanish (Spain) (the English is listed above the line). A name the English has in the plural, as words,
-- may be written with the singular's token from its "plural, as words" line: "Bandidos ({npc:251918})", "{npc:251918} ×8".
-- A token marked "no name in this language" would show in English: write that name in Spanish (Spain) words instead.
-- The comments are rewritten by sync.
return {
	-- Guide
	["A cloth hat in your late 20s: Zardeth's errand for any Alliance player pays warlocks this extra."] = "Un sombrero de tela para los últimos veintes: el encargo de Zardeth para cualquier jugador de la Alianza les paga a los brujos este extra.",

	-- Step 1: Zardeth of the Black Claw
	-- {npc:1435} Zardeth of the Black Claw · {object:2164} Slaughtered Lamb · {object:2101} Mage Quarter · {zone:1431} Duskwood · {zone:1437} Wetlands
	["At 25 {npc:1435}, in the cellar of the {object:2164} in the {object:2101} (beside the warlock trainers), wants two ingredients for a brew. Do it when your leveling takes you to {zone:1431} and the {zone:1437}."] = "A nivel 25 {npc:1435}, en el sótano del {object:2164} en el {object:2101} (junto a los instructores de brujos), quiere dos ingredientes para una poción. Hazlo cuando tu subida te lleve al {zone:1431} y el {zone:1437}.",

	-- Step 2: Tear of Tilloa
	-- {area:1098} Manor Mistmantle · {zone:1431} Duskwood · {area:42} Darkshire · {object:321} Tear of Tilloa · {npc:315} Stalvan Mistmantle
	-- plural, as words: Fetid Corpses = {npc:1270} Fetid Corpse
	["{area:1098} stands in the north-east of {zone:1431}, north of {area:42}. The {object:321} is a small white flower low in the grass of the fenced garden beside Stalvan's house: hard to see, so sweep the garden with your mouse. Fetid Corpses (level 29) wander the grounds and come quickly: at 25, send your voidwalker at the nearest one, grab the flower and leave. {npc:315} (32) is inside the house; leave him alone."] = "El {area:1098} está en el noreste del {zone:1431}, al norte de {area:42}. El {object:321} es una flor blanca pequeña, baja en la hierba del jardín vallado junto a la casa de Stalvan: cuesta verla, así que barre el jardín con el ratón. Los cadáveres fétidos (29) vagan por los terrenos y llegan rápido: a nivel 25, manda a tu guardia apocalíptico contra el más cercano, coge la flor y vete. {npc:315} (32) está dentro de la casa; déjalo en paz.",

	-- Step 3: Musquash Root
	-- {area:836} Dun Algaz · {object:147516} Dark Iron · {area:146} Stonewrought Dam
	["The root grows at the water's edge in the pool below the small falls east of {area:836}, beside the {object:147516} cave below the {area:146}: a tall, spiky wooden root, not at the foot of the dam itself."] = "La raíz crece en la orilla del agua, en la poza bajo las cascadas pequeñas al este de {area:836}, junto a la cueva {object:147516} bajo el {area:146}: una raíz leñosa alta y espinosa, no al pie de la presa misma.",

	-- Step 4: A Noble Brew
	-- {item:2788} Black Claw Stout · {npc:1439} Lord Baurles K. Wishock · {object:2117} Stormwind Keep
	["Back to Zardeth. He brews the {item:2788} and gives it to you for {npc:1439} in the Hall of Petitioners, the first hall on the right inside {object:2117}."] = "Vuelve con Zardeth. Prepara el {item:2788} y te lo da para {npc:1439} en el Salón de los Peticionarios, la primera sala a la derecha dentro del {object:2117}.",

	-- Step 5: You Have Served Us Well
	-- {npc:1733} Zggi
	["Back to Zardeth once more: he offers warlocks a reward, which his imp {npc:1733}, standing beside him, hands over."] = "Vuelve con Zardeth una vez más: ofrece a los brujos una recompensa, que su diablillo {npc:1733}, de pie junto a él, entrega.",
}
